  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing knowledge and networks for capacity building in inclusive rural finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Evidence-based policy guidelines and institutional approaches that constitute good practices by mainstreaming knowledge from diverse professional networks are consolidated.
2. Self-sustaining capacity development programmes at the global and regional level are in place for practitioners to effectively mainstream good practices in their daily activities
3. A more cohesive community of practitioners promotes global knowledge through existing and new knowledge sharing tools, platforms, operations guides</narrative>
  </description>
